# skills.sh writes a duplicate "universal" tree here for Amp, Cline, Codex and
# friends, alongside the canonical .agents/skills. We only target Claude Code,
# and the duplicate drifts out of sync the moment a skill is trimmed.
# Install with: npx skills add <repo> -a claude-code
